  "content": "\n\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1692/809/cdlogo_new-png.png\" width=\"1360\" height=\"370\"></h2>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>一款為 Farmer's Delight 設計的擴充模組，為您帶來&nbsp;</strong><strong>來自世界各地的農作物與料理！</strong></h3>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>已停止支援 1.19 以下版本！</strong></span></span></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>目前收錄的農作物</strong></span></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">酪梨、茄子、黃瓜、玉米</h5>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\">（安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewin-and-chewin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brewin' and Chewin'</a> 後，黃瓜即可醃製）</h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vguyXGI.png\" width=\"258\" height=\"234\"></strong></span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>前期料理</strong></span></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">煙燻茄子、煙燻番茄、酪梨吐司、爆米花、玉米麵糰、墨西哥薄餅、玉米脆片</h5>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afFSB9P.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"258\" height=\"180\"></strong></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><strong>中期料理</strong></strong></span></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">墨西哥烤玉米棒、恩帕那達、辛辣咖哩、燉茄子、牛肉捲餅、雞肉塔可、奶油玉米、豐盛沙拉、羊肉三明治、茄子漢堡、豬肉捲餅、魚肉塔可、茄子帕馬森盛宴、帕馬森茄子套餐</h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sSKOBXY.png\" width=\"420\" height=\"180\"></strong></span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>可食用魷魚類</strong></span></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">魷魚、螢光魷魚、熟魷魚、魷魚圈、熟魷魚圈</h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/liYUVab.png\" width=\"312\" height=\"126\"></strong></span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>壽司與捲物</strong></span></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">蜜瓜壽司捲、雞肉捲、異國壽司拼盤、河豚捲、春捲、熱帶壽司捲、魷魚壽司捲、飯糰</h5>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8NR9IGn.png\" width=\"312\" height=\"180\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">感謝超過 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1200 萬次</span> 的下載！！</span></strong></h3>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">如果您有任何問題、建議，或只是想</span><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">加入社群，</span><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/3CvW3Aw2JM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器！</a></span></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">本模組允許免費用於模組整合包或展示影片中。</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d107\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a> 購買 Kinetic Hosting，首月可享 15% 折扣！</span></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">請務必在結帳時輸入優惠碼！</span></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1337193880688394401/1355010693073604808/Baisylia_New.png?ex=67e75f8c&is=67e60e0c&hm=cd082c86d0f99230eafdce1907fa29eaf469d34512764d11f9d874a6ebd7937d&=&format=webp&quality=lossless\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></span></p>",
